  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">COHRE Organisationsst&#xF6;d 2010--12</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COHRE Programme support 2010--12 - Program support to COHRE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Centre on Housing Rights and Evictions(COHRE),s&#xE4;te i Geneve. COHRE&apos;s m&#xE5;l &#xF6;ver &#xE5;ren har varit att arbeta f&#xF6;r acceptans och genomf&#xF6;rande av ekonomiska, sociala och kulturella m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter. Speciellt r&#xE4;tten till bostad och att hindra vr&#xE4;kningar globalt. COHRE har vuxit och har mer &#xE4;n 60 anst&#xE4;llda och &#xE5;rsbudget p&#xE5; MSEK 20 samt m&#xE5;nga olika givare.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Centre on Housing Rights and Evictions(COHRE,headquarters in Geneva. COHRE&apos;s goal over the years has been to work for acceptance and implementation of economic, social and cultural human rights (ESC), especially the right to adequate housing and prevention of forced evictions world-wide. COHRE has grown considerably, has more than 60 staff and annual budget MSEK 20. And a wide range of donors.</narrative>
  </description>
